1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,170
Mahabharat ka woh khalnayak,
jisne Pandavon ke khilaf yuddh lada tha,

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:07,520
Kerala ke ek gaon mein aaj
bhi unki puja hoti hai!

3
00:00:07,605 --> 00:00:10,015
aur is mandir mein unki
murti tak nahi hai.

4
00:00:10,117 --> 00:00:13,587
yeh mandir Kerala ke Kollam jile
ke Poruvazhi mein sthit hai.

5
00:00:13,672 --> 00:00:15,362
iska naam hai Malanada mandir.

6
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:17,522
yeh mandir Duryodhan ko samarpit hai.

7
00:00:17,616 --> 00:00:21,636
aap soch rahe honge ki aakhir jis
Duryodhan ko Mahabharat mein adharm ka

8
00:00:21,636 --> 00:00:24,966
prateek mana jata hai,
uski puja kyun hoti hai?

9
00:00:25,081 --> 00:00:29,311
sthaneey parampra mein Duryodhan ko
ek alag drishtikon se dekha jata hai.

10
00:00:29,407 --> 00:00:31,587
manyta hai ki jab Pandav vanvaas mein the,

11
00:00:31,587 --> 00:00:36,547
tab unki talash karte hue Duryodhan is
kshetra mein pahunche the aur yahan ke

12
00:00:36,547 --> 00:00:38,377
logon se unka sambandh bana.

13
00:00:38,472 --> 00:00:43,092
is mandir ki sabse anokhi baat yeh hai
ki yahan koi paramprik murti ya garbhgrih

14
00:00:43,092 --> 00:00:43,762
nahi hai.

15
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:47,736
bhakt ek oonche chabutre par,
man se sankalp karke puja karte hain.

16
00:00:47,785 --> 00:00:49,655
aur sabse hairan karne wali baat?

17
00:00:49,683 --> 00:00:52,603
yahan Duryodhan ko toddy yani
Toddy bhi chadhai jati hai,

18
00:00:52,603 --> 00:00:55,593
aur kai bhakt doosri
sharab bhi chadhate hain.

19
00:00:55,658 --> 00:01:00,258
yani Bharat mein ek aisa mandir bhi hai
jahan Mahabharat ke sabse vivadit patron

20
00:01:00,258 --> 00:01:01,908
mein se ek ki puja hoti hai.

21
00:01:01,995 --> 00:01:06,855
aapke hisab se Duryodhan sirf ek khalnayak
tha ya uski kahani ka koi doosra paksh bhi

22
00:01:06,855 --> 00:01:07,365
tha?

